{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_0188XJqQcCea7ei7k8VXmC4E","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Project State Summary\n\n**Problem:** GNU coreutils have no formal specifications. Re-implementations built from documentation diverge on edge cases. This project derives formal specs from C source, generates Go implementations via AI, and verifies parity through differential testing against Homebrew reference binaries.\n\n**Architecture:** Four-stage pipeline (extract, specify, synthesize, verify). Shared libraries: pkg/testutils (diff testing harness), pkg/sys (syscalls, implemented), pkg/format (formatting), pkg/hashutil (checksums), pkg/encutil (encoding), pkg/sizeparse (size parsing, implemented). Each utility lives in cmd/<name>/ with main.go and differential tests.\n\n**Current state:** Repository reset to specs-only on 2026-05-13. Generation run 44 is in progress. Two packages already implemented: pkg/sys (rel00.0-uc003) and pkg/sizeparse (rel00.0-uc006). Task 5087 completed srd003-format R1.1-R1.4 (human-readable size formatting). All other code is not started.\n\n**Current release:** Release 00.0 (foundational infrastructure) is the earliest incomplete release. Remaining use cases with ready requirements: srd003-format (R2.1-R2.7, R3.1-R3.6), srd011-magefiles, srd086-hashutil, srd088-encutil. pkg/testutils (srd001) has no R-items in requirement_states.\n\n## Priority Analysis\n\nRelease 00.0 is the target. srd003-format has 13 ready requirements (R2.1-R2.7 color, R3.1-R3.6 alignment). The package already exists from task 5087, so no contract task is needed. These 13 requirements fill 4 tasks at the 4-sub-requirement-per-task limit.\n\nDependencies: R2.x (color) and R3.x (alignment) are independent feature groups. Within each group, later requirements build on earlier ones.\n\n## Weight Budget Checks\n\nAssuming weight 1 (default) for all srd003-format sub-requirements:\n\n- Task 0: R2.1(w=1) +