- per the srd003-format contract\"\n      - id: D5\n        text: \"Import pkg/sys for IsTerminal. Do not import any cmd/ package.\"\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: \"go build ./pkg/format/... compiles without errors\"\n      - id: AC2\n        text: \"go vet ./pkg/format/... passes without warnings\"\n      - id: AC3\n        text: \"FileTypeColor returns distinct ANSI codes for directories, symlinks, executables, and regular files\"\n      - id: AC4\n        text: \"ColorEnabled returns true when writer is a terminal and no manual override is set\"\n      - id: AC5\n        text: \"SetColorEnabled(false) causes ColorEnabled to return false regardless of terminal status\"\n\n- index: 1\n  title: \"srd003-format R2.5-R2.7: color state reset and extended file types\"\n  dependency: 0\n  description: |\n    deliverable_type: code\n\n    required_reading:\n      - docs/specs/software-requirements/srd003-format.yaml (requirements R2.5 through R2.7)\n      - pkg/format/color.go (color functions from R2.1-R2.4)\n\n    files:\n      - path: pkg/format/color.go\n        action: modify\n        note: ResetColorEnabled and remaining R2 color requirements\n\n    requirements:\n      - id: R1\n        text: \"Implement srd003-format R2.5 -- ResetColorEnabled restores auto-detection of color support, clearing any manual override previously set by SetColorEnabled\"\n      - id: R2\n        text: \"Implement srd003-format R2.6 per the SRD specification\"\n      - id: R3\n        text: \"Implement srd003-format R2.7 per the SRD specification\"\n\n    design_decisions:\n      - id: D1\n        text: \"Signature: func ResetColorEnabled() -- per the srd003-format contract\"\n      - id: D2\n        text: \"Color state uses a package-level variable with three states: auto-detect, forced-on, forced-off. ResetColorEnabled returns to auto-detect.\"\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: \"go build ./pkg/format/... compiles without errors\"\